{"story":{"id":"site-site-hidden-lab-a","title":{"zh":"冰封设施","en":"Frozen Complex"},"category":"precursors","kind":"family","image":"art/35f06426d24cedb29763.webp","start":"archaeological_site_types:site_hidden_lab_a","chapters":5,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"探测器在[From.Planet.GetName]的冰雪之下探测到了一座隐藏的设施。部分坍塌与阻塞的隧道似乎组成了连接各种地下结构的巨大网络","en":"Scanners detect a hidden complex buried beneath the ice and snow of [From.Planet.GetName]. A large network of partially-collapsed or blocked tunnels seems to connect the various underground structures."},"review":{"status":"reviewed","date":"2026-10-13","reviewer":"C2 precursor review (resumed, Claude)","scope":{"zh":"整条故事：遗址的出现方式、全部阶段（按定义顺序）、最后结果及其互斥关系、掷骰失败时的事件池；中英文正文已读。","en":"Whole story: how the site appears, every stage in definition order, the final outcome(s) and their exclusivity, the roll-failure incident pool; both languages read."},"sources":["common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt","events/ancient_relics_arcsite_events_1.txt","common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt","localisation/simp_chinese","localisation/english"],"uncertain":[],"guide":"public/summaries/site-site-hidden-lab-a.md"},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1"]},"n1":{"doc":"archaeological_site_types:site_hidden_lab_a","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry"},"children":["n2"]},"n2":{"doc":"ancrel.7001","parent":"n1","via":{"hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"kind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:1902"},"children":["n3"]},"n3":{"doc":"ancrel.7002","parent":"n2","via":{"kind":"stage","hooks":["stage"],"source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt"},"children":["n4","n5"]},"n4":{"doc":"ancrel.7004","parent":"n3","via":{"kind":"bridge","label":{"zh":"最后阶段完成：随机结果之一（50%）","en":"Final stage completed: one random outcome (50%)"},"conditional":true,"source":"content/stories/site-site-hidden-lab-a.json"},"children":[]},"n5":{"doc