,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0007,"group":"r1","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:35","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"ancrel.8080","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0035,"group":"r1","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:36","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"ancrel.8110","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0035,"group":"r1","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:37","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"federations2.701","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0035,"group":"r1","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:51","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"event-federations2-701"},{"target":"ancrel.4078","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0018,"group":"r1","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:64","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"ancrel.13030","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0035,"group":"r1","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:71","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"ancrel.4006","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0071,"group":"r1","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:90","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"ancrel.4021","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0071,"group":"r1","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:104","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"}],"source":{"file":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt","line":1878},"names":{"From.Planet.GetName":{"zh":"这颗星球","en":"this planet"}},"notes":[{"zh":"勘察天体时，隐藏事件 ancrel.9999（on_survey_planet）以 5/405 的机会生成一个随机考古遗址（AI帝国或5年内刚发现过遗址者机会×0.2），再按各遗址的权重抽取；本遗址要求拥有《远古遗物》，权重1，出现在冰冻星球（pc_frozen）上。权重只有1，是极为罕见的随机遗址。","en":"When a body is surveyed, hidden ancrel.9999 (on_survey_planet) has a 5/405 chance to create a random dig site (×0.2 for AI empires or if a site was found in the last 5 years), then picks a site type by weight; this site needs Ancient Relics and has weight 1 on frozen planets (pc_frozen). With weight 1 it is a very rare random site.","kind":"review"}]},{"id":"ancrel.7001","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"探查遗址","en":"Revealing the Site"},"texts":[{"zh":"[From.Planet.GetName]冰冷的气候将这个遗址掩藏于冰雪之下。这个遗迹荒无人烟的位置也许暗示着其中的存在需要我们谨慎对待。不论里面发生过什么，有人希望尽量将其掩盖。","en":"The freezing climate of [From.Planet.GetName] has covered the site in thick layers of ice and snow. The desolate location of this site may be a hint of the need for discretion. Whatever took place here, someone wanted to keep it hidden."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/b51be10289361fe6e018.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"DIG","label":{"zh":"继续挖！","en":"Keep digging!"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[{"target":"ancrel.7002","kind":"stage","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt","hooks":["stage"],"story":"site-site-hidden-lab-a"}],"source":{"file":"events/ancient_relics_arcsite_events_1.txt","line":6771},"names":{"From.Planet.GetName":{"zh":"这颗星球","en":"this planet"}}},{"id":"ancrel.7002","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"清理隧道","en":"Clearing the Tunnels"},"texts":[{"zh":"这个复合体由几个更大的地下结构以隧道网络连通而成，其中很多都已经坍塌或被冰块封堵。尽管这些隧道十分古老，其中一些仍能看出很明显的火灾的痕迹。这场火灾造成的损害十分巨大，足以使人认为这里发生过灾难性的事件，或是被人有意彻底毁坏。有一件事可以确定，这个遗址在本质上是用于与科学相关的事务。","en":"The complex consists of several larger underground structures connected with a network of tunnels, many of which are collapsed or blocked by ice. Although ancient, some of the tunnels show clear signs of fire. The damage caused by the fire is major enough to suggest a catastrophic event, or perhaps intentional destruction. One thing is sure, and that is that the purpose of this site seems to be scientific in nature."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/872246aedc238ff28ba5.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"INTERESTING","label":{"zh":"真是有趣。","en":"Interesting."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[{"target":"ancrel.7004","kind":"bridge","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"bridge","source":"content/stories/site-site-hidden-lab-a.json","label":{"zh":"最后阶段完成：随机结果之一（50%）","en":"Final stage completed: one random outcome (50%)"},"story":"site-site-hidden-lab-a"},{"target":"ancrel.7005","kind":"bridge","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"bridge","source":"content/stories/site-site-hidden-lab-a.json","label":{"zh":"最后阶段完成：随机结果之一（50%）","en":"Final stage completed: one random outcome (50%)"},"story":"site-site-hidden-lab-a"}],"source":{"file":"events/ancient_relics_arcsite_events_1.txt","line":6796}},{"id":"ancrel.7004","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"远古生物实验室","en":"Ancient Biological Lab"},"texts":[{"zh":"进一步的调查显示，这个站点的主要用途是研究与开发生物制剂。应该是由于这里开发的生物制剂意外泄露，整个建筑群已经用大火净化。对现存文物进行详细的研究，可能会发现一些线索。","en":"Further investigation reveals that the primary purpose of this site seems to have been in the research and development of biological agents. The whole complex seems to have been purged by fire, possibly as the result of the accidental release of one of the biological agents being developed here. With careful and meticulous study of the artifacts that remain, some clues may be found."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/8f8c4a7c3a5dfe3fc7f8.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"OK","label":{"zh":"确认","en":"OK"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/ancient_relics_arcsite_events_1.txt","line":6849}},{"id":"ancrel.7005","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"远古武器实验室","en":"Ancient Weapons Lab"},"texts":[{"zh":"进一步的调查显示，这个站点的主要目的是研究与开发先进的能量武器。一场事故似乎引发了一场灾难性的爆炸并摧毁了大部分场地。站点中的一座数据中心似乎还保持着相对良好的状态，也许它的数据能够带来一些有用的启示。","en":"Further investigation reveals that the primary purpose of this site seems to have been in the research and development advanced energy weapons. An accident seems to have triggered a catastrophic explosion, which eradicated most of the site. One data-center seems to be in relatively good condition, perhaps its data will yield some useful insights?"}],"sections":[],"image":"art/c6521a2bac2bb7c2248c.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"OK","label":{"zh":"确认","en":"OK"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/ancient_relics_arcsite_events_1.txt","line":6881}}],"summary":{"text":"# 冰封设施 / Frozen Complex\n\n- 分类 Category：先驱者与考古 Precursors · 来源 Sources：common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:1878；events/ancient_relics_arcsite_events_1.txt:6772 · DLC：《远古遗物》Ancient Relics · 审阅 Reviewed 2026-10-13\n\n## 如何开始 How it starts\n\n勘察天体时，隐藏事件 ancrel.9999（on_survey_planet）以 5/405 的机会生成一个随机考古遗址（AI帝国或5年内刚发现过遗址者机会×0.2），再按各遗址的权重抽取；本遗址要求拥有《远古遗物》，权重1，出现在冰冻星球（pc_frozen）上。权重只有1，是极为罕见的随机遗址。\n\nWhen a body is surveyed, hidden ancrel.9999 (on_survey_planet) has a 5/405 chance to create a random dig site (×0.2 for AI empires or if a site was found in the last 5 years), then picks a site type by weight; this site needs Ancient Relics and has weight 1 on frozen planets (pc_frozen). With weight 1 it is a very rare random site.\n\n## 剧情脉络 Story outline\n\n冰层下隐藏着一座被烈火净化过的科研设施。两个阶段之后，隐藏事件 ancrel.7003 以50/50抽出实验室的性质：生物实验室或武器实验室。\n\n1. 探查遗址：冰雪覆盖的遗址，有人曾想隐瞒这里发生的事\n2. 清理隧道：清理坍塌或冻结的隧道，处处有火烧的痕迹\n\nA research complex buried under ice and purged by fire. After two stages hidden ancrel.7003 draws, 50/50, whether it was a biological or a weapons lab.\n\n1. Revealing the Site: a site buried in ice — someone wanted it hidden\n2. Clearing the Tunnels: clearing collapsed and frozen tunnels scarred by fire\n\n## 分支与结局 Branches and outcomes\n\n- 远古生物实验室 / Ancient Biological Lab：研发生物制剂，似因泄漏被烈火焚毁（社会学研究奖励） / ancient biological lab: research on biological agents, apparently burned after a leak (society research)\n- 远古武器实验室 / Ancient Weapons Lab：高能武器事故导致爆炸，数据中心尚存（等离子科技选项30%） / ancient weapons lab: an accident destroyed it but a data centre survived (plasma weapons tech option, 30%)\n\n## 条件与文明差异 Conditions and variants\n\n- 无特殊的文明差异。 / No empire-specific variants beyond the reward wording.\n- 掷骰失败时使用通用事件池 all_random_events（见“考古遗址：发掘意外”）。 / Failed rolls use the generic pool all_random_events (see \"Archaeological Sites: excavation incidents\").\n\n## 审阅记录 Review notes\n\n- 已核对：遗址定义（common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:1878）的阶段顺序与条件、各阶段事件脚本、出现方式；中英文正文已读。\n- Checked: the site definition (common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:1878) with its stage order and conditions, every stage event script, and how the site appears; both languages read.\n- 结构修正：最后一个阶段事件 ancrel.7003 是隐藏的随机分派，草稿把它的几个互斥结局错排成连续阶段；现改为最后可见阶段之后的互斥分支。\n- Structural fix: the last stage event ancrel.7003 is a hidden random dispatcher; the draft chained its exclusive endings as consecutive stages. They are now exclusive branches after the last visible stage.\n","path":"summaries/site-site-hidden-lab-a.md"}}